      "title": "UCX runs first and touches nothing",
      "items": [
        "Assessment crawls tables, UDFs, grants, mounts, jobs, and init scripts before anything changes",
        "Cross-cloud external locations are explicitly not supported -- flags them for Delta Sharing instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Three tools move in parallel, not in sequence",
      "items": [
        "Lakebridge converts up to 80% of a warehouse migration automatically, gated by its Validator",
        "Asset Bundles provision the target as versioned code while Replicator keeps it warm for dual-run"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Every tool stops at the same edge: judgment",
      "items": [
        "Classic compute differs across clouds -- clusters and jobs need a manual re-map even after import",
